  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat Xalt is a responsive polyamide multifilament designed to combine comfort, control and a firmer, more precise response. Its multifilament matrix absorbs vibration effectively, while specific polyamide fibres create a more reactive impact feel than very soft traditional multifilaments. Made in France using a solvent-free process, Xalt is particularly well suited to players who want arm-friendly comfort without losing directional control and responsiveness.",

    "zh": "Babolat Xalt 是一款强调舒适、控制与快速响应的聚酰胺多芯球线。其多芯矩阵结构能够有效吸收震动，而特殊聚酰胺纤维则让击球反馈比传统柔软型多芯线更加扎实、直接和灵敏。Xalt 在法国制造，并采用无溶剂工艺，非常适合希望保护手臂，同时又不想牺牲线路控制与击球响应速度的中高级俱乐部球员。"
  },

